Enable the instance extensions OpenXR v1 runtimes (WiVRn/Monado) require.

When an app drives Vulkan through Dawn (wgpu::CreateInstance), the runtime
never creates its own VkInstance: it inspects the app-created one. Monado's
v1 XR_KHR_vulkan_enable path resolves on that instance and then blindly calls,
among others, vkGetPhysicalDeviceProperties2KHR. The Vulkan loader returns
NULL for KHR-named entry points unless the extension string was part of the
instance's enabledExtensionNames (core 1.1 promotion alone does not suffice).
Monado does not null-check, so the first such call becomes a SIGSEGV inside
libopenxr_wivrn.so.

Dawn's VkInstance only requests Dawn's own known InstanceExt set (Surface
variants, DebugUtils, ValidationFeatures) because Dawn relies on core 1.1
functions internally. This patch adds the four OpenXR-required instance
extensions so they are requested whenever advertised, and additionally adds
VK_KHR_external_fence_fd to the known device extensions so the external
memory/fence/semaphore function pointers Monado resolves on Dawn's VkDevice
(vkGetMemoryFdKHR, vkGetFenceFdKHR, ...) are non-NULL.

Instance extensions required by the runtime (comp_vk_glue.c):
  VK_KHR_get_physical_device_properties2
  VK_KHR_external_fence_capabilities
  VK_KHR_external_memory_capabilities
  VK_KHR_external_semaphore_capabilities

Device extension additionally required for Monado's FD sync object use:
  VK_KHR_external_fence_fd

Applied to the vendored Dawn tree by aurora-main/cmake/AuroraDawnProvider.cmake
after dawn-vulkan-native-handles.patch when AURORA_DAWN_PROVIDER=vendor, the
only configuration the standalone Quest target uses.

diff --git a/src/dawn/native/vulkan/VulkanExtensions.cpp b/src/dawn/native/vulkan/VulkanExtensions.cpp
index 5487266..3cf4142 100644
--- a/src/dawn/native/vulkan/VulkanExtensions.cpp
+++ b/src/dawn/native/vulkan/VulkanExtensions.cpp
@@ -52,6 +52,12 @@ static constexpr std::array<InstanceExtInfo, kInstanceExtCount> sInstanceExtInfo
 
     {InstanceExt::DebugUtils, "VK_EXT_debug_utils"},
     {InstanceExt::ValidationFeatures, "VK_EXT_validation_features"},
+
+    // OpenXR required instance extensions
+    {InstanceExt::GetPhysicalDeviceProperties2, "VK_KHR_get_physical_device_properties2"},
+    {InstanceExt::ExternalFenceCapabilities, "VK_KHR_external_fence_capabilities"},
+    {InstanceExt::ExternalMemoryCapabilities, "VK_KHR_external_memory_capabilities"},
+    {InstanceExt::ExternalSemaphoreCapabilities, "VK_KHR_external_semaphore_capabilities"},
     //
 }};
 
@@ -95,6 +101,16 @@ InstanceExtSet EnsureDependencies(const InstanceExtSet& advertisedExts) {
                 hasDependencies = true;
                 break;
 
+            case InstanceExt::GetPhysicalDeviceProperties2:
+                hasDependencies = true;
+                break;
+
+            case InstanceExt::ExternalFenceCapabilities:
+            case InstanceExt::ExternalMemoryCapabilities:
+            case InstanceExt::ExternalSemaphoreCapabilities:
+                hasDependencies = HasDep(InstanceExt::GetPhysicalDeviceProperties2);
+                break;
+
             case InstanceExt::AndroidSurface:
             case InstanceExt::FuchsiaImagePipeSurface:
             case InstanceExt::MetalSurface:
@@ -163,6 +179,7 @@ static constexpr std::array<DeviceExtInfo, kDeviceExtCount> sDeviceExtInfos{{
     {DeviceExt::ExternalMemoryDmaBuf, "VK_EXT_external_memory_dma_buf"},
     {DeviceExt::ExternalMemoryZirconHandle, "VK_FUCHSIA_external_memory"},
     {DeviceExt::ExternalMemoryHost, "VK_EXT_external_memory_host"},
+    {DeviceExt::ExternalFenceFD, "VK_KHR_external_fence_fd"},
     {DeviceExt::ExternalSemaphoreFD, "VK_KHR_external_semaphore_fd"},
     {DeviceExt::ExternalSemaphoreZirconHandle, "VK_FUCHSIA_external_semaphore"},
     //
@@ -229,6 +246,7 @@ DeviceExtSet EnsureDependencies(const DeviceExtSet& advertisedExts,
             case DeviceExt::ExternalMemoryFD:
             case DeviceExt::ExternalMemoryZirconHandle:
             case DeviceExt::ExternalMemoryHost:
+            case DeviceExt::ExternalFenceFD:
             case DeviceExt::ExternalSemaphoreFD:
             case DeviceExt::ExternalSemaphoreZirconHandle:
             case DeviceExt::QueueFamilyForeign:
